WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 39=

5
01:44.080 --> 01:44.570
Come on.

6
01:45.130 --> 01:47.290
I've come up with a good solution.

7
01:48.360 --> 01:49.050
If...

8
01:49.850 --> 01:52.130
If Mu Xun catches up with me...

9
01:53.440 --> 01:55.720
Chancellor Liu and Yan Shang are both dead anyway.

10
01:56.960 --> 01:57.690
I'll just say

11
01:58.320 --> 01:59.690
it was Mu Wanyao!

12
02:00.440 --> 02:01.930
She's the real usurper!

13
02:04.880 --> 02:05.770
Yan Shang is dead?

14
02:06.520 --> 02:06.770
I...

15
02:07.770 --> 02:10.040
I was forced to flee to Hangzhou!

16
02:11.040 --> 02:13.480
I... I can give him back the throne.

17
02:15.880 --> 02:16.640
How did he die?

18
02:17.920 --> 02:18.720
It's settled, then.

19
02:19.040 --> 02:20.090
I'll definitely survive!

20
02:20.370 --> 02:21.640
I'll definitely survive!

21
02:22.410 --> 02:24.160
Sitting on this throne

22
02:24.480 --> 02:26.130
is like sitting on a brazier.

23
02:26.810 --> 02:28.040
It's burning my backside!

24
02:30.010 --> 02:30.440
Oh, right.

25
02:31.480 --> 02:32.370
Before I leave,

26
02:33.530 --> 02:34.880
there's one more thing to do

27
02:36.410 --> 02:37.690
to make absolutely sure I'm safe.

28
02:40.410 --> 02:42.320
I'll abdicate in favor of Si'er.

29
02:43.640 --> 02:45.160
I'll become the Retired Emperor!

30
02:48.970 --> 02:49.690
What did Your Majesty

31
02:51.480 --> 02:52.090
just say?

32
02:53.850 --> 02:55.570
I'll abdicate in favor of Si'er.

33
02:56.760 --> 02:58.530
I'll become the Retired Emperor!

34
02:59.760 --> 03:00.370
Think about it.

35
03:01.320 --> 03:02.810
If Mu Xun catches up with me,

36
03:03.160 --> 03:05.640
he won't kill a Retired Emperor.

37
03:12.810 --> 03:13.410
Yes, yes.

38
03:14.880 --> 03:15.290
Exactly.

39
03:16.370 --> 03:17.090
So...

40
03:19.290 --> 03:20.880
You'll put Si'er in harm's way

41
03:22.440 --> 03:24.010
to die in your place?

42
03:28.090 --> 03:28.480
Come on!

43
03:29.040 --> 03:29.920
Draft the edict

44
03:30.370 --> 03:31.090
for me right now.

45
03:31.200 --> 03:31.920
There's no time to lose!

46
03:35.920 --> 03:36.320
Wait.

47
03:39.690 --> 03:40.290
What if...

48
03:41.920 --> 03:43.530
What if Sheng'an doesn't fall,

49
03:44.880 --> 03:46.250
and this was all a false alarm?

50
03:47.570 --> 03:50.200
What if Mu Wanyao comes back?

51
03:51.290 --> 03:51.690
Then what?

52
03:54.530 --> 03:55.200
Si'er...

53
03:56.090 --> 03:56.880
Chunhua...

54
03:57.440 --> 03:58.530
The emperor is young, and his mother is strong.

55
03:59.410 --> 04:01.949
Chunhua and Mu Wanyao are in league.

56
04:01.991 --> 04:02.831
What if...

57
04:03.690 --> 04:06.440
What if she helps Wanyao seize Si'er?

58
04:06.810 --> 04:07.090
Then...

59
04:08.810 --> 04:10.130
then this edict

60
04:10.970 --> 04:13.640
would be my death warrant.

61
04:15.320 --> 04:16.440
Your Majesty,

62
04:18.280 --> 04:19.760
how thoughtful of you now.

63
04:22.610 --> 04:23.080
Come here!

64
04:27.370 --> 04:28.370
Write this down.

65
04:29.760 --> 04:31.200
I'll abdicate at once.

66
04:32.320 --> 04:32.810
And

67
04:35.050 --> 04:36.840
order the Noble Consort's execution.

68
04:43.130 --> 04:43.760
Hurry up!

69
04:45.080 --> 04:45.960
Why aren't you moving?

70
04:46.490 --> 04:47.170
You don't expect me

71
04:47.760 --> 04:50.349
to take Chunhua to Hangzhou, do you?

72
04:50.391 --> 04:51.751
There's no time!

73
04:52.130 --> 04:53.400
Cui Quan is preparing the carriage.

74
04:53.930 --> 04:56.200
I must leave in an hour!

75
04:56.370 --> 04:57.170
And before that,

76
04:58.080 --> 04:59.690
she must be executed!

77
05:01.250 --> 05:01.840
Quick!

78
05:18.760 --> 05:19.640
Once you've drafted the edict,

79
05:20.960 --> 05:21.960
carry out the order for me and hang her.

80
05:22.810 --> 05:24.280
Where's my imperial seal?

81
05:27.170 --> 05:29.010
Where has my seal gone?

82
05:42.490 --> 05:43.280
Found it!

83
05:54.610 --> 05:54.960
Don't!

84
06:38.250 --> 06:39.400
You've committed

85
06:40.440 --> 06:41.810
far too many evil deeds.

86
06:45.840 --> 06:46.840
You've ruined

87
06:47.520 --> 06:48.520
Chunhua's life,

88
06:48.960 --> 06:50.370
and mine too!

89
07:04.010 --> 07:04.610
Your Majesty,

90
07:05.520 --> 07:07.170
when are we leaving?

91
07:22.690 --> 07:24.200
His Majesty needs a little more time.

92
07:26.730 --> 07:28.010
Attendant Liu,

93
07:28.440 --> 07:29.170
you're here?

94
07:30.730 --> 07:32.280
His Majesty wants to see the consort.

95
07:33.490 --> 07:34.570
Send for her immediately.

96
08:18.760 --> 08:19.250
Chunhua,

97
08:21.080 --> 08:21.570
come with me.

98
08:32.490 --> 08:32.730
Come.

99
08:34.280 --> 08:34.640
Look.

100
08:45.640 --> 08:46.130
Don't be afraid.

101
08:47.920 --> 08:48.370
Don't be afraid.

102
08:51.800 --> 08:52.680
He's dead now.

103
08:56.850 --> 08:58.040
I'm finally free.

104
09:00.880 --> 09:01.520
Wenji,

105
09:02.490 --> 09:03.760
you've committed regicide.

106
09:13.680 --> 09:14.090
Chunhua,

107
09:18.210 --> 09:19.370
stay and talk with me for a while.

108
09:35.680 --> 09:36.210
Chunhua,

109
09:39.010 --> 09:39.640
do you know

110
09:41.680 --> 09:43.610
why I never proposed to you back then?

111
09:48.010 --> 09:49.040
Perhaps

112
09:50.450 --> 09:52.880
I hadn't made you love me enough.

113
10:06.730 --> 10:07.130
No.

114
10:10.280 --> 10:11.090
It was because

115
10:13.730 --> 10:14.800
I was weak,

116
10:16.640 --> 10:17.330
selfish,

117
10:19.160 --> 10:20.250
and a coward.

118
10:30.280 --> 10:32.520
I knew you were a maid,

119
10:33.880 --> 10:35.330
not a noblewoman from Sheng'an.

120
10:36.880 --> 10:37.610
And I was frustrated.

121
10:41.800 --> 10:42.680
I reserved

122
10:44.280 --> 10:46.090
the place of my lawful wife

123
10:47.130 --> 10:48.640
until I'd passed the imperial exam,

124
10:50.520 --> 10:51.610
so I could marry

125
10:53.010 --> 10:53.680
a noblewoman

126
10:54.850 --> 10:57.040
from one of the great clans.

127
11:11.040 --> 11:12.400
I've often wondered over the years...

128
11:17.680 --> 11:19.800
If I'd proposed to you back then,

129
11:21.850 --> 11:23.330
none of this would have happened.

130
11:24.680 --> 11:26.250
The night Si'er was born,

131
11:31.560 --> 11:33.330
the life we dreamed of together

132
11:34.330 --> 11:35.610
could have been real.

133
11:55.400 --> 11:55.880
Chunhua,

134
11:58.010 --> 11:58.760
you must be

135
12:01.330 --> 12:02.210
so disappointed in me.

136
12:34.850 --> 12:36.400
Forgive my boldness,

137
12:37.210 --> 12:38.760
but when will His Majesty

138
12:39.370 --> 12:40.850
and the Noble Consort depart?

139
12:44.250 --> 12:46.130
His Majesty and I must speak in private.

140
12:46.490 --> 12:47.130
No one is to come in!

141
13:06.520 --> 13:07.450
Wenji, what's wrong?

142
13:08.490 --> 13:09.280
Did you poison yourself?

143
13:09.680 --> 13:10.210
Wenji!

144
13:16.850 --> 13:17.130
I...

145
13:19.040 --> 13:20.040
I feel terrible...

146
13:23.560 --> 13:24.010
Chunhua,

147
13:26.280 --> 13:26.920
please let me

148
13:28.400 --> 13:29.330
rest in your arms

149
13:30.280 --> 13:31.250
for a little while.

150
13:51.800 --> 13:52.880
He deserved to die.

151
13:55.370 --> 13:57.280
But you shouldn't have died with him.

152
13:58.250 --> 13:59.010
It's not worth it.

153
14:05.970 --> 14:06.800
It is worth it.

154
14:09.330 --> 14:10.400
Only with him dead

155
14:12.400 --> 14:13.370
can you and Si'er

156
14:15.040 --> 14:16.800
live safely and in peace.

157
14:17.250 --> 14:19.010
But all I want is for you to live!

158
14:30.880 --> 14:31.610
Don't cry.

159
14:35.880 --> 14:36.400
Please don't cry.

160
16:10.800 --> 16:11.680
You're so beautiful.

161
16:25.130 --> 16:25.520
Wenji!

162
16:26.490 --> 16:26.920
Wenji!

163
16:29.370 --> 16:29.970
Wenji!

164
16:38.330 --> 16:38.880
Wenji.

165
16:42.640 --> 16:44.160
The first time I met you,

166
16:46.250 --> 16:47.680
I fell in love with you.

167
16:48.320 --> 16:51.280
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

168
16:52.490 --> 16:54.069
But only after returning to Sheng'an

169
16:54.111 --> 16:55.661
did I realize how I felt.

170
16:56.550 --> 17:00.320
♪The moon wanes and waxes, lovers part and reunite♪

171
17:00.370 --> 17:01.160
I thought

172
17:01.160 --> 17:03.830
♪One moment too late, love slips from sight♪

173
17:03.880 --> 17:05.650
we would never meet again.

174
17:05.650 --> 17:07.650
♪I've tasted the ache of wanting in vain♪

175
17:07.650 --> 17:08.970
But I never imagined

176
17:08.970 --> 17:12.230
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

177
17:13.010 --> 17:14.690
you'd come to Sheng'an to find me.

178
17:14.690 --> 17:17.020
♪As darkness engulfs the palace and wildlands sway♪

179
17:17.140 --> 17:19.600
♪What can I do, with no one to light the way?♪

180
17:19.600 --> 17:21.170
From the very beginning,

181
17:24.320 --> 17:26.760
I've always loved you.

182
17:28.970 --> 17:30.450
I love you so much.

183
17:31.050 --> 17:33.010
♪Fate falls just short of granting our plea♪

184
17:33.060 --> 17:35.660
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

185
17:35.710 --> 17:38.410
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

186
17:39.610 --> 17:43.330
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

187
17:44.010 --> 17:45.120
That's...

188
17:45.162 --> 17:46.580
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

189
17:47.040 --> 17:48.040
wonderful to hear.

190
17:48.082 --> 17:49.710
♪May sorrow end, though sleepless we lie apart♪

191
17:49.760 --> 17:52.090
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

192
17:52.300 --> 17:55.240
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

193
18:08.600 --> 18:09.170
Chunhua,

194
18:10.600 --> 18:11.280
in a little while,

195
18:12.560 --> 18:14.650
when all this is over,

196
18:15.400 --> 18:17.510
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

197
18:17.560 --> 18:18.320
go back

198
18:18.970 --> 18:19.930
to your room,

199
18:21.840 --> 18:22.800
hold Si'er close,

200
18:24.730 --> 18:25.520
and get

201
18:25.562 --> 18:27.200
♪The moon wanes and waxes, lovers part and reunite♪

202
18:27.250 --> 18:28.080
some good sleep.

203
18:28.122 --> 18:29.990
♪One moment too late, love slips from sight♪

204
18:30.040 --> 18:31.210
Do you understand?

205
18:31.930 --> 18:34.400
♪I've tasted the ache of wanting in vain♪

206
18:34.450 --> 18:35.210
I will.

207
18:35.600 --> 18:39.310
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

208
18:40.170 --> 18:41.560
You should sleep too, Wenji.

209
18:41.602 --> 18:44.100
♪As darkness engulfs the palace and wildlands sway♪

210
18:44.220 --> 18:46.270
♪What can I do, with no one to light the way?♪

211
18:46.320 --> 18:47.170
Do you remember

212
18:49.080 --> 18:50.600
our little village?

213
18:50.642 --> 18:54.070
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

214
18:55.560 --> 18:56.800
You'll dream of it.

215
18:58.130 --> 19:00.090
♪Fate falls just short of granting our plea♪

216
19:00.930 --> 19:02.120
I can already

217
19:04.010 --> 19:05.170
see it.

218
19:06.690 --> 19:10.360
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

219
19:11.280 --> 19:11.800
There are

220
19:11.842 --> 19:13.510
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

221
19:13.560 --> 19:14.280
mountains,

222
19:14.710 --> 19:16.470
♪May sorrow end, though sleepless we lie apart♪

223
19:16.520 --> 19:17.410
rivers,

224
19:17.452 --> 19:19.130
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

225
19:19.970 --> 19:20.520
and...

226
19:20.562 --> 19:22.350
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

227
19:27.120 --> 19:29.210
those flowers.

228
19:30.110 --> 19:32.770
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

229
19:33.630 --> 19:35.590
♪Fate falls just short of granting our plea♪

230
19:35.640 --> 19:38.240
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

231
19:38.290 --> 19:40.990
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

232
19:42.190 --> 19:45.910
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

233
19:46.710 --> 19:49.160
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

234
19:50.210 --> 19:52.290
♪May sorrow end, though sleepless we lie apart♪

235
19:52.340 --> 19:54.670
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

236
19:54.880 --> 19:57.820
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

237
19:58.880 --> 20:05.740
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides, through fading grass and setting suns♪

238
20:07.160 --> 20:10.720
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

239
20:11.220 --> 20:14.330
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

240
20:17.790 --> 20:22.800
♪How sweet the spring, how hard to leave♪

241
20:31.450 --> 20:33.520
The criminal Liu Wenji

242
20:34.080 --> 20:35.800
committed regicide and treason

243
20:36.250 --> 20:37.840
and has been executed.

244
20:55.210 --> 20:57.360
Your Majesty, my condolences!

245
20:58.210 --> 20:59.120
Ministers, listen carefully!

246
21:01.170 --> 21:02.210
I have an imperial decree

247
21:03.170 --> 21:04.320
to proclaim throughout the realm.

248
21:08.490 --> 21:09.650
Mu Xun, the deposed Crown Prince,

249
21:10.930 --> 21:11.970
was blessed with imperial favor,

250
21:13.490 --> 21:14.760
yet raised the banner of rebellion

251
21:15.170 --> 21:16.360
and attacked the imperial capital,

252
21:18.280 --> 21:20.040
letting his followers hurt the people.

253
21:21.170 --> 21:22.210
All officials

254
21:22.760 --> 21:24.930
must honor the valor of the Grand Princess, Guardian of the Realm

255
21:25.410 --> 21:26.730
and the steadfast integrity

256
21:27.560 --> 21:28.650
of Yan Shang, Commandant of the Guards.

257
21:29.490 --> 21:30.520
I hereby issue this solemn decree

258
21:32.280 --> 21:33.410
to every circuit

259
21:35.360 --> 21:36.170
as a warning

260
21:37.280 --> 21:38.080
to all.

261
21:40.970 --> 21:43.760
We obey the Empress Dowager's decree!

262
21:54.970 --> 21:56.450
Only a hundred more li to Sheng'an.

263
21:57.600 --> 21:57.930
Change horses.

264
21:58.120 --> 21:58.360
Yes.

265
22:02.560 --> 22:03.170
Urgent report!

266
22:09.650 --> 22:10.120
Your Highness, urgent news!

267
22:10.650 --> 22:11.730
Everyone inside the city still holds.

268
22:12.010 --> 22:13.010
The rebels haven't broken through.

269
22:14.840 --> 22:15.210
But...

270
22:15.930 --> 22:17.120
the city is out of arrows and food.

271
22:17.450 --> 22:18.760
Commander Yan died defending the city.

272
22:23.840 --> 22:24.360
Who...

273
22:26.490 --> 22:27.210
did you say was killed?

274
22:28.040 --> 22:28.490
Yan Shang.

275
22:29.250 --> 22:30.170
Yan Shang, Commandant of the Guards.

276
23:21.080 --> 23:21.490
Your Highness!

277
23:22.970 --> 23:23.280
Your Highness!

278
23:41.930 --> 23:42.410
Go.

279
23:44.650 --> 23:45.250
Sheng'an

280
23:48.490 --> 23:49.410
still needs reinforcements.

281
23:53.600 --> 23:54.080
Give me a hand.

282
23:54.410 --> 23:54.800
Sir.

283
23:55.490 --> 23:56.760
Your hands are shaking. Take a break.

284
23:57.120 --> 23:57.732
- I'll take over. - I'm not stopping.

285
23:58.360 --> 23:59.490
We can't let the wall fall.

286
24:07.760 --> 24:08.690
Here, give that to me.

287
24:08.970 --> 24:10.210
Look at those injuries on your hands.

288
24:10.690 --> 24:13.520
We've used up all our arrows and powder.

289
24:14.250 --> 24:15.360
All we have left are bricks and stones.

290
24:16.970 --> 24:17.490
Give us a hand.

291
24:17.690 --> 24:18.520
Come on, come on.

292
24:19.320 --> 24:19.800
Move.

293
24:21.890 --> 24:22.170
Come on.

294
24:25.010 --> 24:25.250
Here.

295
24:25.690 --> 24:25.989
(Peace Throughout the Realm) Thank you.

296
24:26.031 --> 24:26.431
It's fine.

297
24:28.450 --> 24:28.760
Your Royal Highness.

298
24:28.970 --> 24:29.730
The new emperor has passed away.

299
24:30.010 --> 24:31.010
Is the news confirmed?

300
24:31.490 --> 24:32.120
Without a doubt.

301
24:32.320 --> 24:33.280
An official report came from Jinzhou.

302
24:33.450 --> 24:34.120
The funeral has already been held.

303
24:34.760 --> 24:35.450
Congratulations, Your Royal Highness!

304
24:36.360 --> 24:37.010
As I thought,

305
24:37.600 --> 24:38.800
Heaven's mandate is still mine.

306
24:42.360 --> 24:43.170
Beat the war drums!

307
24:51.520 --> 24:52.930
The wound is serious.

308
24:56.080 --> 24:59.080
I wonder if anything else can be done.

309
25:00.080 --> 25:01.189
It's not getting any better.

310
25:01.231 --> 25:01.991
Yes.

311
25:02.280 --> 25:03.259
Do you think Imperial Physician Huang

312
25:03.301 --> 25:04.991
has any way to treat it?

313
25:09.490 --> 25:10.560
We must trust the physician.

314
25:27.010 --> 25:27.760
Attend me.

315
25:33.210 --> 25:34.210
Is anyone there?

316
25:54.800 --> 25:55.690
Someone, come!

317
26:03.320 --> 26:03.930
Your Majesty.

318
26:07.360 --> 26:08.010
Where is everyone?

319
26:09.730 --> 26:10.690
Where have they all...

320
26:13.800 --> 26:14.840
You're crying?

321
26:16.970 --> 26:17.690
Whatever for?

322
26:18.040 --> 26:18.560
I've heard

323
26:19.360 --> 26:20.320
the city gate is about to fall.

324
26:22.360 --> 26:23.730
And that's why you're crying?

325
26:27.170 --> 26:30.250
The realm hasn't fallen yet. Why are you crying?

326
26:31.520 --> 26:32.800
I'm still here!

327
26:58.320 --> 26:59.890
Help me get dressed.

328
28:02.360 --> 28:03.730
Your Royal Highness, look at the gate tower!

329
28:04.970 --> 28:05.560
It's His Majesty!

330
28:13.320 --> 28:14.250
Father.

331
28:16.450 --> 28:17.840
You haven't fled after all.

332
28:18.420 --> 28:22.620
(Guanghua Gate)

333
28:22.930 --> 28:23.600
Mu Xun.

334
28:25.600 --> 28:26.760
Do you know your crime?

335
28:30.600 --> 28:31.120
Father,

336
28:32.600 --> 28:33.930
your precious chosen son

337
28:34.800 --> 28:36.250
has abandoned the city and fled.

338
28:36.600 --> 28:37.170
I wonder

339
28:38.170 --> 28:39.730
what you think of him now.

340
28:40.280 --> 28:41.280
I think

341
28:42.730 --> 28:44.690
a coward who flees the city

342
28:45.930 --> 28:48.600
is better than a monstrous traitor!

343
28:53.690 --> 28:55.760
If you hadn't taken everything from me,

344
28:57.320 --> 28:58.520
none of this would have happened.

345
28:58.890 --> 29:00.250
Ever since you were young,

346
29:01.410 --> 29:03.450
I taught you military strategy

347
29:04.490 --> 29:07.520
so that one day you'd defend the realm,

348
29:08.280 --> 29:11.930
not turn your sword on Sheng'an!

349
29:13.840 --> 29:14.210
I

350
29:15.250 --> 29:16.450
have lived a life of mere survival.

351
29:18.010 --> 29:19.170
I was no great emperor.

352
29:20.690 --> 29:22.170
But as a ruler,

353
29:22.690 --> 29:23.690
however incompetent I may be,

354
29:24.320 --> 29:26.040
I must never turn my army

355
29:26.360 --> 29:28.320
against my own people!

356
29:29.250 --> 29:29.890
But you

357
29:30.560 --> 29:33.450
have plunged our realm into war

358
29:34.170 --> 29:35.600
and exposed countless innocent people

359
29:36.520 --> 29:37.560
to its flames!

360
29:41.840 --> 29:43.210
Traitors and rebels

361
29:43.840 --> 29:45.650
deserve to die at everyone's hands!

362
30:02.730 --> 30:03.280
Urgent report, Your Royal Highness!

363
30:03.490 --> 30:05.760
Princess Danyang leads the North Jing cavalry

364
30:06.250 --> 30:07.210
and provincial troops. They're 50 li away!

365
30:10.580 --> 30:13.220
(Guanghua Gate)

366
30:21.730 --> 30:22.280
Fall back!

367
30:24.520 --> 30:25.410
Retreat!

368
30:32.620 --> 30:35.060
(Guanghua Gate)

369
30:56.760 --> 30:57.080
Your Majesty.

370
30:57.250 --> 30:57.629
Your Majesty.

371
30:57.671 --> 31:00.551
(Guanghua Gate)

372
31:00.600 --> 31:01.280
I'm fine.

373
31:02.360 --> 31:03.450
You've all endured enough.

374
31:06.080 --> 31:07.080
Go on. Leave me.

375
32:50.360 --> 32:54.410
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

376
33:25.060 --> 33:26.300
(Huai)

377
33:59.320 --> 34:00.970
I knew she'd seek reinforcements,

378
34:01.450 --> 34:02.970
but I didn't expect them so soon.

379
34:03.410 --> 34:04.120
How many are there?

380
34:04.600 --> 34:05.560
Perhaps a hundred thousand.

381
34:07.760 --> 34:08.850
Go negotiate with Mu Wanyao.

382
34:09.560 --> 34:10.160
Get her to stop her troops.

383
34:11.850 --> 34:12.200
Your Royal Highness,

384
34:12.930 --> 34:14.010
I volunteer to go.

385
34:15.770 --> 34:16.640
If the talks fail,

386
34:17.560 --> 34:18.560
I'll accept any military punishment.

387
34:22.520 --> 34:23.120
Tan Yuanchun!

388
34:24.200 --> 34:24.520
Here!

389
34:25.330 --> 34:25.770
You go.

390
34:26.560 --> 34:26.850
Yes!

391
34:59.890 --> 35:01.810
I'm here on the Crown Prince's behalf

392
35:02.120 --> 35:03.890
to speak to the Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm.

393
35:09.120 --> 35:11.370
You and your brother have many misunderstandings.

394
35:12.010 --> 35:12.970
As an outsider,

395
35:13.410 --> 35:14.160
it's not my place to interfere.

396
35:14.600 --> 35:15.810
But there's one thing

397
35:16.200 --> 35:17.490
I must tell Your Highness.

398
35:18.330 --> 35:19.200
Yan Shang...

399
35:19.330 --> 35:19.680
Shut up!

400
35:21.200 --> 35:22.370
How dare you say his name?

401
35:23.040 --> 35:23.520
Your Highness,

402
35:24.160 --> 35:25.120
Yan Shang is alive.

403
35:33.890 --> 35:34.600
What did you say?

404
35:35.520 --> 35:37.160
Commander Yan was wounded and captured,

405
35:37.490 --> 35:38.200
but he's alive.

406
35:38.640 --> 35:40.410
He's in the Crown Prince's tent.

407
35:48.520 --> 35:50.850
You hardly know me, General Tan.

408
35:52.450 --> 35:53.290
So you have no idea

409
35:54.010 --> 35:55.040
what happens to those

410
35:55.890 --> 35:56.970
who dare lie to me.

411
35:58.890 --> 36:00.240
Yan Shang is alive.

412
36:00.930 --> 36:02.040
You'll see for yourself, Your Highness.

413
36:03.120 --> 36:04.720
If you agree to withdraw your troops

414
36:05.120 --> 36:06.720
and discuss affairs with the Crown Prince,

415
36:07.450 --> 36:10.560
he'll guarantee Yan Shang's safety.

416
36:15.560 --> 36:16.490
You say he's alive.

417
36:19.160 --> 36:19.850
What proof do you have?

418
36:20.160 --> 36:20.810
If you don't believe me,

419
36:21.160 --> 36:22.520
come with me and see him yourself.

420
36:23.080 --> 36:23.890
Your Highness, you mustn't.

421
36:24.680 --> 36:25.120
Your Highness,

422
36:25.640 --> 36:26.680
Yan Shang is gravely wounded.

423
36:27.290 --> 36:27.850
Seeing you

424
36:28.560 --> 36:30.200
would surely give him the will to live.

425
36:32.200 --> 36:33.040
How badly wounded?

426
36:34.850 --> 36:35.290
So badly

427
36:36.770 --> 36:37.850
he couldn't even send me a token?

428
36:40.810 --> 36:41.450
He sent a message.

429
36:42.160 --> 36:45.330
Several words for you, Your Highness.

430
36:46.560 --> 36:47.810
Patience will bring things right.

431
36:48.450 --> 36:49.520
There is still time ahead.

432
36:55.040 --> 36:55.520
Your Highness,

433
36:56.410 --> 36:58.200
once the Crown Prince takes Taiji Palace,

434
36:58.890 --> 37:00.290
he'll let you keep your title

435
37:00.930 --> 37:02.290
and let you choose your own fief.

436
37:06.410 --> 37:07.160
What fief?

437
37:08.410 --> 37:09.290
My home

438
37:09.770 --> 37:10.520
is here in Sheng'an!

439
37:10.970 --> 37:11.410
Your Highness,

440
37:11.850 --> 37:12.659
every word I've said is true...

441
37:12.701 --> 37:14.061
Say one more word,

442
37:14.970 --> 37:16.010
and I'll have you cut to pieces!

443
37:17.640 --> 37:18.040
Take him away!

444
37:30.890 --> 37:31.240
Your Highness,

445
37:32.770 --> 37:33.560
do you think that messenger

446
37:34.770 --> 37:35.330
was telling the truth?

447
37:45.600 --> 37:46.810
If Yan Shang really had been captured,

448
37:50.080 --> 37:51.240
he would have kept his mouth shut.

449
37:54.520 --> 37:55.770
He'd never have sent me a single word.

450
37:57.370 --> 37:58.120
So...

451
37:59.160 --> 38:00.770
Yan Shang really is...

452
38:00.970 --> 38:01.290
Gu Han.

453
38:11.640 --> 38:12.370
(Mu Xun.)

454
38:13.930 --> 38:15.410
(You're asking for it.)

455
38:23.450 --> 38:23.770
Your Royal Highness!

456
38:24.290 --> 38:25.080
His Majesty has passed away.

457
38:29.080 --> 38:29.930
Father...

458
38:33.930 --> 38:34.770
He's already...

459
38:40.240 --> 38:40.680
Your Royal Highness,

460
38:41.450 --> 38:42.200
we can't miss this chance.

461
38:43.240 --> 38:43.810
Let's attack the city.

462
38:48.770 --> 38:49.680
Attack the city.

463
38:53.200 --> 38:54.080
Attack!

464
39:52.260 --> 39:53.320
(Guanghua Gate)

465
40:12.240 --> 40:13.290
All troops, heed my command!

466
40:14.970 --> 40:15.890
Follow me and crush the rebels!

467
40:16.490 --> 40:17.010
Beat the drums!

468
40:18.540 --> 40:20.580
(Huai)

469
40:23.010 --> 40:26.940
Kill! Kill!

470
40:26.990 --> 40:30.970
Kill! Kill!

471
40:31.120 --> 40:31.930
- Those who yield shall live! - Kill! Kill!

472
40:32.560 --> 40:33.429
- Those who resist shall die! - Kill!

473
40:33.471 --> 40:37.438
Kill! Kill!

474
40:37.480 --> 40:41.520
Kill! Kill!

475
41:19.330 --> 41:19.810
(Yan Shang,)

476
41:20.890 --> 41:21.810
(get over here this instant!)

477
42:02.540 --> 42:06.980
♪A bamboo basket brims with lychees♪

478
42:07.620 --> 42:11.300
♪At dusk, our little boat drifts along♪

479
42:12.220 --> 42:17.060
♪Sunset clouds crown the treetops♪

480
42:17.060 --> 42:21.020
♪We drift on beyond twilight♪

481
42:21.820 --> 42:26.300
♪Words fail me over this cup of wine♪

482
42:26.780 --> 42:30.100
♪I still fear my ambitions may go unfulfilled♪

483
42:31.060 --> 42:39.380
♪Pour out my cup and stir up the sea♪

484
43:07.290 --> 43:10.330
Your Royal Highness, must this go on even now?

485
43:11.080 --> 43:11.850
On the battlefield,

486
43:12.850 --> 43:13.640
we fight until one side dies!

487
43:14.720 --> 43:15.970
We never had a choice!

488
43:17.450 --> 43:17.890
Yang Si,

489
43:18.970 --> 43:19.490
tonight,

490
43:20.290 --> 43:21.240
come with me

491
43:22.010 --> 43:23.080
and break through this city gate!

492
43:35.600 --> 43:37.080
(I'll put an end to all of this.)

493
43:46.240 --> 43:47.560
Yang Si!

494
43:48.930 --> 43:49.520
Come back...

495
44:51.140 --> 44:55.780
(Next Episode Preview)

496
44:55.850 --> 44:56.600
As a child,

497
44:57.370 --> 44:59.330
I used to imagine my wedding day.

498
44:59.720 --> 45:00.410
Later,

499
45:01.160 --> 45:03.450
I thought I'd never want to marry.

500
45:04.080 --> 45:06.120
I never thought I'd be lucky enough

501
45:07.080 --> 45:08.490
to marry her in this life.

502
45:09.850 --> 45:10.810
The ceremony is complete.

503
45:14.921 --> 45:18.214
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

504
45:20.899 --> 45:25.815
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

505
45:28.009 --> 45:33.854
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

506
45:34.354 --> 45:39.580
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

507
45:42.349 --> 45:47.140
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

508
45:47.976 --> 45:54.055
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

509
45:55.856 --> 45:59.006
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

510
45:59.006 --> 46:00.654
♪Burning bright as a song♪

511
46:00.706 --> 46:04.430
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

512
46:04.808 --> 46:09.474
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

513
46:10.093 --> 46:14.134
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

514
46:14.625 --> 46:16.740
♪Not a single hour less♪

515
46:16.780 --> 46:23.726
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

516
46:24.489 --> 46:27.942
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

517
46:28.122 --> 46:31.267
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

518
46:31.706 --> 46:38.343
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

519
46:38.740 --> 46:40.778
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

520
46:40.778 --> 46:43.254
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

521
46:43.292 --> 46:45.761
♪You're the only one I need♪

522
46:45.965 --> 46:52.852
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

523
46:53.164 --> 46:56.435
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

524
46:56.740 --> 46:59.913
♪My last untouched innocence♪

525
47:00.237 --> 47:03.663
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

526
47:03.896 --> 47:07.121
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

527
47:07.452 --> 47:14.248
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

528
47:14.617 --> 47:16.679
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

529
47:16.680 --> 47:19.183
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

530
47:19.230 --> 47:21.568
♪You're the only one I need♪

531
47:21.799 --> 47:28.634
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

532
47:28.983 --> 47:30.601
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

533
47:30.731 --> 47:32.527
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

534
47:32.884 --> 47:35.901
♪You're the only one I need♪

535
47:35.941 --> 47:37.268
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
